## Acceptance criteria coverage
- blueprint generated from a fixture repo: `envSnapshot.test.ts` ("generates a
  blueprint from the manifest and writes loam.env.yaml")
- first build runs setup steps, second boot reuses snapshot (counter assert):
  "runs the setup steps once, then reuses the cached snapshot" + E2E real-shell
  test
- hash change triggers rebuild: "the hash changes when the lockfile changes" /
  "rebuilds when the hash changes" / "bootTaskFromSnapshot ignores a stale
  snapshot after the lockfile changes"
- secret values never appear in logs: "preserves hand-written secrets as NAMES
  only", "injects a resolved secret into the child env only", "redacts a secret
  echoed by a setup step", "fails the build when a referenced secret is missing"

