## fc-03: `video_studio` agent tool (FilmCraft actions)

fc-03 complete. The merge gate failure was a single conflict in
`docs/filmcraft-integration.md` (manus-parity tip `dc1c68d`, merge base
`6ad123d`). Resolved keeping BOTH sides: the incoming fc-01 vendor-fetch refresh
section (`npm run vendor:filmcraft` / `scripts/vendor/fetch-filmcraft.mjs` /
`docs/vendor-dists.md`) and this branch's `video_studio` action/command-mapping
documentation are both present. Resolution committed as `5b3766d Merge
manus-parity into fc-03: keep both the vendor fetch docs and the video_studio
mapping`. `git merge-tree --write-tree manus-parity HEAD` exits 0.

### What fc-03 delivers
- `src/tools/videoStudio.ts`: the single `video_studio` agent tool driving the
  FilmCraft editor through the fc-02 relay (`src/server/videoStudioRelay.ts`).
  Actions: `open`, `state`, `import`, `cut`, `trim`, `delete` (ripple), `move`,
  `reorder`, `split`, `speed`, `add_text`, `add_audio` / `music`,
  `transition_basic`, `effect_basic`, `undo`, `raw`.
  - Command ids are never hardcoded: `VIDEO_STUDIO_COMMAND_CANDIDATES` is
    resolved against the live `commands()` catalog at runtime via
    `resolveCommandId`; an unexposed id returns the looked-for ids, Levenshtein
    close matches and the full catalog so the agent can retry with `raw`.
  - Time args accept seconds and timecode (`toSeconds` / `toSecondsArray`).
  - Fallback contract returns `ok:false` with `fallback: "video_edit"` for
    `filmcraft_dist_missing` / `bridge_unavailable` / `command_rejected` /
    `cancelled`, and `retry: true` for `panel_not_open`.
- `src/server/videoStudioRelay.ts`: enqueues commands per task, streams them over
  SSE, settles one at a time, times out, rejects with `COMMAND_REJECTED`,
  ignores unknown ids, and cancels queued/in-flight commands on task stop.
- Registration: `video_studio` in `src/server/runTools.ts` (`ALWAYS_ON_TOOLS`)
  and in `src/policy/riskTier.ts`.
- Docs: `docs/filmcraft-integration.md` gains the actions table, the
  command-candidate mapping, the time-argument grammar and the fallback table.
- Tests: `src/tools/__tests__/videoStudio.test.ts` (mocked relay: every action's
  command sequence, unknown-id rejection with close matches, fallback paths,
  reorder permutation contract, effect_basic name precedence),
  `src/server/__tests__/videoStudioRelay.test.ts`,
  `src/server/__tests__/videoStudioE2E.test.ts` (real server + relay + SSE route).

